5. Neural-network model weights (engines in models/)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  The .engine files are TensorRT-compiled forms of the following publicly
  released weights. Authoritative per-model data (license, source, SHA-256) is in
  models/manifest.json and models/download_weights.py in the source repository.

  span_x2         SPAN 2x - weights "2xNomosUni_span_multijpg"
                  by Helaman / Phhofm (https://github.com/Phhofm/models)
                  License: CC BY 4.0 (attribution required: "2xNomosUni_span_multijpg
                  by Helaman / Phhofm, CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/").
                  Architecture: SPAN by Cheng Wan et al., "Swift Parameter-free
                  Attention Network" (https://github.com/hongyuanyu/SPAN), Apache-2.0.
                  The weights are converted to ONNX and compiled to an engine
                  (a modification in format only).
  animevideov3_x4 Real-ESRGAN "realesr-animevideov3" (https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN)
                  License: BSD 3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2021 Xintao Wang.
  x4plus          Real-ESRGAN "RealESRGAN_x4plus" (optional download)
                  License: BSD 3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2021 Xintao Wang.
  rife_v4         RIFE 4.x flownet weights (https://github.com/hzwer/Practical-RIFE,
  rife_v4_lite    converted by https://github.com/HolyWu/vs-rife). Code and weights: MIT,
                  Copyright (c) hzwer (Huang Zhewei) et al.

  Model weights are not part of the MIT-licensed project code. Engines other than
  the default set are downloaded on request (`filming-better models pull <id>`)
  and verified by SHA-256.

